Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] lab(#53 W2A-G): settled-only content-aware detail repaint
 guard

At rest, skip a detail paint whose canvas content would be identical to
what is painted (frame, visible themes, per-layer tier, alpha and tile
set, exact coverage, backing size). Lab probe on Q1-C at 2.5x with
zero coverage slack: an unchanged render request repainted 2x, a
same-theme request 5x, a 1 px resize 4x (~110-170 ms each); 8x with
slack repainted 0x. Motion keeps the existing rules; the escape inset is
unchanged (W1b's inset strategy stays rejected). Legitimate tier
upgrades, alpha/theme changes, late tiles, coverage or backing changes
change the key and still paint (scripts/detail-content-contracts.mjs).

Quackles Lab candidate on top of Q1-C 1b637ed1. Not for promotion.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
